lowing them to shoot jets of flame from their trunks. The ability makes sure that any would-be predator knows that Trebhum may be too spicy for food (especially for those with fur!)<br><br><strong>New graphics options!</strong><br>The Eternal Cylinder now supports 4K AND ray tracing make your journey to salvation the most vivid and immersive ever! Enjoy this gorgeous world the way it was meant to be seen, even more vividly!",
